==Battleground==
*3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Calamary|Calamaries]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

